repository-code: "https://github.com/RichieSater/stringer-bound"
url: "https://github.com/RichieSater/stringer-bound"
abstract: >-
  Source and exact rational computations for the nine-page preprint
  Ordered simplex caps and the three-observation Stringer bound. The
  tetrahedral cap theorem gives the sharp pointwise Stringer-Gaffke
  comparison range for three observations. Proposed five- and six-coordinate
  global extensions remain conjectural because of an explicit active-prefix
  proof obligation. Separate research notes and a systematic-PPS manuscript
  retain their own mathematical scopes.
keywords:
